    {
      "inlines": [
        {
          "text": "讀書之樂在於明理。晨起展卷，清風入窗；夜深秉燭，文字如友。今輯詩文數篇，列於簡冊，以供吟詠。",
          "kind": "text",
          "annotation": "",
          "target": "",
          "boxed": true,
          "seal_style": "red"
        }
      ],
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "indent": 0,
      "level": 1,
      "style": "preface",
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "inlines": [
        {
          "text": "讀書不覺已春深，一寸光陰一寸金。",
          "kind": "text",
          "annotation": "",
          "target": "",
          "boxed": true,
          "seal_style": "red"
        }
      ],
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "indent": 0,
      "level": 1,
      "style": "preface",
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "inlines": [
        {
          "text": "歲次丙午仲秋　简牍書屋識",
          "kind": "text",
